> import: media

###
Read one sentence aloud with the local speech model the caller selected.

The model reads the prompt as written, so the sentence is the whole prompt.
The procedure returns the audio value itself, not its text rendering.
###
@speak(sentence: str) -> Audio:
  [speech: Audio] << <sentence>
  = `speech`

# run.py binds this file: `sentence` arrives as a global.
= `speak(sentence)`
